{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"cost","value":"free","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"data_provided","value":"per-permit record: request_num, permission_num/date, expiry_date, open_request date, building_num, yechidot_diyur (housing units), tama_38 flags, sug_bakasha (request type free text), tochen_bakasha (request content free text, up to 4000 chars - describes rooms/pool/etc), finished date, occupation date (טופס אכלוס), tr_hathalat_bniya (construction start), building_stage (5-value status: בתהליך היתר/קיים היתר/בבניה/תעודת גמר/קיים אכלוס), maslul_rishuy, addresses, tik_binyan file numbers, hakala (relief/variance) fields, date_import","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"spatial","value":"esriGeometryPolygon per building/parcel, sourceSpatialReference wkid 2039 (old Israeli ITM/CS), reprojectable via ArcGIS outSR param","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"cross_ref_key","value":"address (addresses field, free text) + building_num (internal building code) + tik_binyan (building-file numbers, 5 slots) + polygon geometry; no gush/helka field observed directly","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"update_cadence","value":"verified near-live: sampled top-3 records by date_import DESC all showed date_import = 17/07/2026 00:52:43, i.e. same-day as this research (today 2026-07-17) - daily or better refresh","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"sports_filterable","value":"partial - no structured category field for sport; must LIKE-filter tochen_bakasha/sug_bakasha free text for keywords (e.g. ספורט/בריכה/מגרש/אולם ספורט); verified query with 'ספורט' returns results but many are false-positive-prone (free text)","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"israel_coverage","value":"single authority: Tel Aviv-Yafo only. 10,538 records total (verified via returnCountOnly=true)","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv-Yafo GIS - בקשות והיתרי בניה (IView2 layer 772)","field":"reliability","value":"official municipal source, live production ArcGIS service (currentVersion 11.1); ToS not checked but publicly linked from TLV OpenData portal developer page (opendata.tel-aviv.gov.il/he/Pages/developer.aspx) implying sanctioned reuse","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
